      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "ALTERNATIVELY, What if we could skip the middleman and allow something like VRCLens to be able to save images straight to our PC without the need of even using the default camera? I know there's the new update being worked on that allows world creators to have a way to save images and video straight to our PCs, maybe this could be used on a prefab like VRCLens as well?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
