  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-02-02T12:34:06.653Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Would it be possible to have a lite camera option? This would mean a super lightweight camera with no other features other than a display and capture. This would allow external cameras like VRCLens to run a lot more smoothly and have better frames. Before we got the current camera we have now back when we did, the camera was a lot more lightweight and having it and VRCLens active didn't cause as much lag as it does now with the current camera.",
